---
title: Hardcore challenge rules for Zelda TotK
---
div.border-start.border-4.border-primary.ps-3.mb-4
  h5.text-primary.fw-bold #[i.fa-solid.fa-circle-info] Note
  p These are subject to change
h3 Goal(s)
ul: li Complete all main quests
h3 Rules
ul
  li Can't use Amiibos
  li Must use pro HUD
  li Can't use the paraglider
  li Can't fast travel
  li Permadeath
  li Can't use Fuse (including arrows)
  li Can't eat during battle
  li No special effect food/potions
p The following glitches are banned:
ul
  li Any form of duplication (items, weapons or Zonai devices)
  li Zuggling
  li Fuse entanglement (including variants involving Mineru)
  li Auto-Build Cancel
  li Arrow smuggling
